title: VMware vCenter Server Appliance: Pending Shutdown
agents: vcsa_health
catalog: app/vmware
license: GPL-2.0-only
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check reports whether a shutdown or reboot has been scheduled on a
 VMware vCenter Server Appliance (VCSA), including the scheduled time and
 the recorded reason. The data is retrieved by the special agent
 {agent_vcsa_health}.

 A pending action is {WARN} by default, configurable via the ruleset "VCSA
 pending shutdown". The service is always discovered and reports {UNKNOWN}
 if the status cannot be retrieved, so it cannot silently disappear.

discovery:
 One service is created per appliance.
